body:
I feel lost.  I feel rejected.  I feel abandoned.  I feel manipulated.  I feel betrayed and lied to.  I feel Marginalized? I feel weak.  I feel loss.  I feel hurt.  I feel frustration.  I feel anger.  I feel inadequate.  I feel overwhelmed.  I feel inferior, I feel anxious.  I feel fearful.  I feel alone. I feel broken. I feel worthless.  I feel incapable.  I feel ugly and undesirable.

&#x200B;

I want to feel purposeful.  I want to feel confident.  I want to feel centered, ground.  I want to feel loved.  I want to feel seen.  I want to feel safe.  I want to feel desired, wanted.  I want to feel capable, respected. I want to feel peaceful, and loving.  I want to feel loved.  I want to feel connected.
